./ R 00149100 00150000 $ 00149200 100                                           
*  THE LABEL HERE IS SIO, WHICH IS ALSO A MNEMONIC -- THAT     XA0017DK         
*  HAS ALWAYS BEEN TRUE IN THIS MODULE AND STILL ASSEMBLES.    XA0017DK         
*  R-26: *-4 NAMES IT.                                         XA0017DK         
SIO      XASIO R10                                             XA0017DK         
         BC    7,SIO                                           XA0017DK         
./ R 00163000 00166000 $ 00163100 100                                           
SAVST1   XASIO R10            START SENSE IO                   XA0017DK         
         BNZ   SAVST1         ..                               XA0017DK         
SAVCL1   XATIO R10            CLEAR IO                         XA0017DK         
         BNZ   SAVCL1         ..                               XA0017DK         
./ R 00166050 00166100 $ 00166051 001                                           
SAVCL2   XATIO R10            DRAIN ANY INTERRUPTS             XA0017DK         
         BC    7,SAVCL2                                        XA0017DK         
SAVST2   XASIO R10            START IT UP                      XA0017DK         
         BC    7,SAVST2       UNTIL FREE                       XA0017DK         
SAVWT2   XATIO R10            TEST FOR COMPLETION              XA0017DK         
         BC    7,SAVWT2       TRY AGAIN                        XA0017DK         
./ I 00685000 $ 00685100 100                                                    
*  NO XC OR MVCL EXISTS ANYWHERE IN DMKSAV, SO NOTHING ZEROES  XA0017DK         
*  THIS AND THE PLACEMENT NEEDED NONE OF DMKCKP'S CARE.        XA0017DK         
*  XABLOKS LAST: IT ENDS IN DSECTS. I-55.                      XA0017DK         
         XAIOWORK             XAIO WORK AREAS AND LOOKUP       XA0017DK         
         COPY  XABLOKS        FOR ORBCCWFM, THE CCW FORMAT     XA0017DK         
